{
  "id": "p01",
  "rule": "the read permission matrix of the posts collection: each caller (anonymous, the administrator, the editor bob, the author carol, dave as administrator of another site only, erin as a member of another site only) asks for each status of carol's and bob's posts; the status sanitizer refuses what the caller may not ask for, the totals count the rows the caller reads",
  "setup": [
    {
      "leave": "erin"
    },
    {
      "own_site": "dave"
    },
    {
      "post": "p:publish-carol",
